  CONSISTENCY -- win rate, variance of outcomes, standard risk metrics
####################################################################################################################
  group                                        n   win%  wrthls%  meanRet%  sdRet%  Sharpe     PF   maxDD   top%
  FILTERED (IV rank top-tercile)             362    97%      96%    +69.3%  248.0%   +0.38   1.22   97.0%    23%
                                             put: n= 181 win  94%   call: n= 181 win  99%
  UNFILTERED (control, no IV condition)      616    97%      97%    +60.0%  535.4%   +0.53   1.25   98.0%    18%
